Chapter: DerivingShow
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Codex chapter General

 `deriving Show` generates a structural show for a user type: the
 constructor name followed by each field shown in order.

Section: Types

  Color = | Red | Green | Blue  deriving Show

  Shape =
    | Circle (Integer)
    | Rect (Integer) (Integer)
    deriving Show

Section: Opening

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show Green)
    print-line-uni (show Red)
    print-line-uni (show (Circle 5))
    print-line-uni (show (Rect 3 4))
  end

